From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dinesh Choudhary <idinesh@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:46:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] feat(qti): enable nord RPMh and CMD DB support

Add the Nord RSC register layout and message RAM parameters for RPMh.
Define the Nord AOP command DB mapping and APSS HM and AOSS address
ranges.

Nord configuration was checked for the Nord SoC.

Co-authored-by: Shivam Sanjay <shivsanj@qti.qualcomm.com>
Assisted-by: OpenAI:gpt-5 [codex]
Signed-off-by: Dinesh Choudhary <idinesh@qti.qualcomm.com>
Change-Id: I7b11d7a302b9278bd9ce546f0c92bfe93b926175
Link: https://review.trustedfirmware.org/c/TF-A/trusted-firmware-a/+/55337
Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/trusted-firmware-a/pull/132]
Signed-off-by: Roshan Sivakumar <roshs@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
